# Caddyfile — PMD D&D Platform reverse proxy   [Phase 2, Story 1]
#
# REFERENCE COPY of the authoritative file on the server at
#     /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
# Verified against the live file on July 7, 2026. If they ever
# diverge, the LIVE server file wins.
#
# HTTPS-PENDING: at domain cutover —
#   1. change the site address below from the raw IP to the real domain
#   2. delete the "tls internal" line (Caddy then fetches a trusted
#      Let's Encrypt certificate automatically)
#   3. open 80/tcp in UFW (ACME challenge + automatic http->https redirect)

https://<droplet-IP> {
	tls internal
	reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}